  "description": "OpenTelemetry wiring for the DotNetCore.Lutter resilience kernel. Registers the meter and the activity source the telemetry package publishes - one scope name covering both signals - with an OpenTelemetry host's MeterProviderBuilder and TracerProviderBuilder. It carries no SDK and no exporter: the host keeps its own, so this package never decides a protocol or an endpoint for anyone. Also carries the one-way metric-name migration table that older observability surfaces can be moved onto.",
